            <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Shortcut</div>
            <div style="margin: 0 0 4px 0;">If both quantities are multiplied by the <strong>same number</strong>, the unit rate stays the same.</div>
