            <div style="margin: 0 0 3px 0;">Multiply both by 3:</div>
            <div style="margin: 0;"><span style="color: #1167b1; font-weight: bold;">12 items</span> for <span style="color: #a85a00; font-weight: bold;">$72</span> &rarr; same unit rate.</div>
