            <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 15pt; margin: 0 0 4px 0;">Shortcut Example</div>
            <div style="margin: 0 0 3px 0;">Original: 5 items for $40</div>
            <div style="margin: 0 0 3px 0;">Row: 15 items for $120</div>
            <div style="margin: 0 0 3px 0;"><span style="color: #1167b1; font-weight: bold;">5 &rarr; 15</span> means multiply by 3.</div>
            <div style="margin: 0 0 3px 0;"><span style="color: #a85a00; font-weight: bold;">40 &rarr; 120</span> also means multiply by 3.</div>
            <div style="margin: 0;"><strong>Answer:</strong> Same unit rate.</div>
